[{:db/id "q-117602/selection/73c4e490d7921e567abfe52f6352a621d74e5fedb6c3870110c08a0d841019cd" :answer/id #uuid "7b47b3ec-49c3-5b98-85e6-8a24012c5eb2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{\\pi }{12}+\\frac{n\\pi }{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117602/selection/e6dbd7b065d33b79c6a630b2dcca4eb3395b609f38fc276664456bf1c9ca5c59" :answer/id #uuid "9162ee2a-6cdb-56f3-9e3a-4191f2c150a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{\\pi }{12}+\\frac{n\\pi }{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117602/selection/fea1881ea7e6afe222cb2f217d9d45513da0a8458b90d87ac3001174c88336e0" :answer/id #uuid "142c8849-4839-5cd6-b89f-91eb77dd8132" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{\\pi }{6}+\\frac{n\\pi }{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117602/selection/5a8a209305bd25719f22c6c519520429a5c77063235f8b2901a3ca050fd18812" :answer/id #uuid "d297be78-6b18-5764-828d-4036913d5056" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{\\pi }{6}+\\frac{n\\pi }{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117602/selection/760fb1f8debca13dbcf6cbb1b70547d9fe4adad72a1a7f84cacc3ff412370a80" :answer/id #uuid "450970ca-f928-5619-ae9a-30f056ec8122" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=\\frac{\\pi }{12}+\\frac{n\\pi }{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-117602/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0984caf9-b184-57a5-9825-7fa55d59f7df" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-117602/selection/73c4e490d7921e567abfe52f6352a621d74e5fedb6c3870110c08a0d841019cd" :answer-field/choices ["q-117602/selection/73c4e490d7921e567abfe52f6352a621d74e5fedb6c3870110c08a0d841019cd" "q-117602/selection/e6dbd7b065d33b79c6a630b2dcca4eb3395b609f38fc276664456bf1c9ca5c59" "q-117602/selection/fea1881ea7e6afe222cb2f217d9d45513da0a8458b90d87ac3001174c88336e0" "q-117602/selection/5a8a209305bd25719f22c6c519520429a5c77063235f8b2901a3ca050fd18812" "q-117602/selection/760fb1f8debca13dbcf6cbb1b70547d9fe4adad72a1a7f84cacc3ff412370a80"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-117602" :question/id #uuid "ce138d4b-3afe-53d4-858e-58f0c3cbf6af" :question/math-academy-id "q-117602" :question/problem "Which expression gives all of the zeros of $y=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})?$  Assume that $n$ is an integer." :question/worked-solution "First, let's start by defining a new variable $X$ as\n\n$$\nX=3x-\\frac{\\pi }{4}.\n$$\n\nSo, we need to calculate the zeros of \n\n$$\ny=\\operatorname{sin}⁡X.\n$$\n\nThe zeros of this function are given by the following expression:\n\n$$\nX=n\\pi \n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer.\n\nTo find the zeros of our original function, we rewrite $X$ in terms of the original variable $x$ and solve the resulting equation for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}X & =n\\pi  \\\\ 3x-\\frac{\\pi }{4} & =n\\pi  \\\\ 3x & =\\frac{\\pi }{4}+n\\pi  \\\\ x & =\\frac{\\pi }{12}+\\frac{n\\pi }{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the zeros are $x=\\frac{\\pi }{12}+\\frac{n\\pi }{3},$ where $n$ is any integer." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-117602/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "58c7cd44-30a9-5f61-822c-13640ad41c93"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-117602"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-81523/selection/0c69afd3c33b7558a2dc59dcecbc21f9101d90ff4f979df22d22f3c8ebd60bbc" :answer/id #uuid "1f174a6b-9d54-5f5c-b7b8-2b37ec7d01bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x={90}^{∘}+n\\cdot {720}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81523/selection/8d28c48f67ddede01b444a59b6f5157d86d43d37232f7fe756d594fdc8fa0234" :answer/id #uuid "212d01c6-1510-5219-8de6-98c1e7f467dc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x={90}^{∘}+n\\cdot {45}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81523/selection/1a21102038fe74ee913054cdc6aaabe3c7b7fc13a662000f0d4678049ee40fb9" :answer/id #uuid "1d4cfffe-d